From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: gpu_display: blit Wayland scanout to a host-owned 8-bit DMA-BUF

GPU_DISPLAY_COPY_MODE=gpu selects the Wayland EGL/GLES path. Fence the read
before returning from RESOURCE_FLUSH and use wl_buffer.release to reuse the
linear GBM outputs. At six occupied outputs wait up to 16 ms before growing
the pool to at most eight. Keep the shared-memory path as the fallback.

